 3. ⚡️ Catch me up 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data: The Downballot , Ballotpedia , AP ; Chart: Erin Davis/Axios 📊 In the seven states where Republicans redrew congressional boundaries, they're on track to lose as many as eight seats — rather than gain the 15 they had hoped to pick up. More from Hans Nichols . 🍔 Traffic at McDonald's restaurants in the U.S. fell during Q3 as customers struggled with high gas prices and other costs. Go deeper . 💊 CVS Health is splitting its health and pharmacy services businesses into two public companies, reversing a get-big strategy involving mergers with prescription benefits provider Caremark and insurance firm Aetna. More from Brock E.W. Turner . 
 
